sequenceDiagram

participant User
participant AlertService
participant DB
participant EventBridge
participant Consumer
participant RT as Realtime Middleware
participant WS as WebSocket
participant FE as Frontend

User->>AlertService: Update Alert

AlertService->>DB: Save Alert Changes

DB-->>AlertService: Success

AlertService->>EventBridge: Publish AlertUpdated.v1

EventBridge->>Consumer: Deliver Event

Consumer->>Consumer: Execute Business Logic

Consumer->>RT: Realtime enabled?

RT->>RT: Determine recipients

RT->>RT: Transform payload

RT->>WS: Publish websocket event

WS->>FE: ALERT_UPDATED

FE->>FE: invalidateQueries()

FE->>AlertService: GET /alerts